<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Optex
Richardson (OPX) &#8211; Richardson, Texas</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Optex
Richardson revenue is primarily in support of prime and subcontracted military customers. Approximately <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--DomesticMilitaryCustomersMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zOhA9NmOvKQh" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_DomesticMilitaryCustomersMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001009" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">91</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Optex Richardson segment
revenue is comprised of domestic military customers, and <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ForeignMilitaryCustomersMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zVA2N9UqyzJ2" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_ForeignMilitaryCustomersMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001011" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9</ix:nonFraction></span>% is comprised of foreign military customers. For the nine months ended June
28, 2026, Optex Richardson represented <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zsh2vzf0grv" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001013" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">57</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total consolidated revenue and consisted of revenue from the U.S. government
(<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USDefenseContractorMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zTuNkFUSwyd8" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USDefenseContractorMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001015" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">19</ix:nonFraction></span>%), and two major U.S. defense contractors (<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USDefenseContractorOneMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_z8BVfE2R5p13" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USDefenseContractorOneMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001017" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">19</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USDefenseContractorTwoMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zd95jTrZqJdc" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USDefenseContractorTwoMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001019" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">13</ix:nonFraction></span>%).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Optex
Richardson is located in Richardson Texas, with leased premises consisting of approximately <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--AreaOfLand_iI_usqft_c20260628__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zpQH3qrOOFij" title="Leased facilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AreaOfLand" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-28_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001021" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">49,100</ix:nonFraction></span> square feet. As of June 28, 2026,
the Richardson facility operated with <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--NumberOfEmployees_uInteger_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zaecSOQ6ASUg" title="Number of employees"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:NumberOfEmployees" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact001023" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">95</ix:nonFraction></span> full-time equivalent employees in a single shift operation. The facilities at Optex Richardson
serve as the home office for both the Optex Richardson and Applied Optics Center segments.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Applied
Optics Center &#8211; Dallas, Texas</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Applied Optics Center serves primarily domestic U.S. customers. Sales to commercial customers represent <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--CommercialCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zVtGmnAG3Awk" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_CommercialCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001025" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% and military sales to prime
and subcontracted customers represent <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--SubcontractedCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zKS4navhz6Xc" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_SubcontractedCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001027" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the total external segment revenue for the nine months ended June 28, 2026. Approximately
<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ExternalCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_z76gfSOtrrf7" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_ExternalCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001029" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">92</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the AOC revenue was derived from external customers and approximately <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MilitaryContractsMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__custom--IntersegmentSalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zgLiYK3WGVLg" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_MilitaryContractsMember_custom_IntersegmentSalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001031" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8</ix:nonFraction></span>% was related to intersegment sales to Optex Richardson
in support of military contracts. For the nine months ended June 28, 2026, AOC represented <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_z6TKEJIxMPt4" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001033" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">43</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total consolidated
revenue and consisted of revenue from three major defense contractors representing <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MajorUSDefenseContractorOneMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zCxHTU2Qj6Kl" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_MajorUSDefenseContractorOneMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001035" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">11</ix:nonFraction></span>%, <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MajorUSDefenseContractorTwoMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zxMKdqcJUxya" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_MajorUSDefenseContractorTwoMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001037" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20250929__20260628__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MajorUSDefenseContractorThreeMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_ztz4uPj9ieu1" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_MajorUSDefenseContractorThreeMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001039" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated
revenue, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Applied Optics Center is located in Dallas, Texas with leased premises consisting of approximately <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AreaOfLand_iI_usqft_c20260628__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zx2bEh2zJlz5" title="Leased facilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AreaOfLand" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-28_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001041" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">44,867</ix:nonFraction></span> square feet of space. As of
June 28, 2026, AOC operated with <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--NumberOfEmployees_uInteger_c20250929__20260628__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zeSmx2VAqRL" title="Number of employees"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:NumberOfEmployees" contextRef="From2025-09-292026-06-28_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact001043" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">45</ix:nonFraction></span> full-time equivalent employees in a single shift operation.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

