    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i id="xdx_F1D_zEZTbkBEVu01"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001476" xml:lang="en-US">Assumes
    a discount borrowing rate of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseDiscountRate_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20260628_zYnT2JMnl8Wd" title="Borrowing discount rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNjaGVkdWxlIG9mIE5vbi1jYW5jZWxsYWJsZSBPcGVyYXRpbmcgTGVhc2VzIE1pbmltdW0gUGF5bWVudHMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDiscountRate" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-28" id="Fact001478" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the facilities lease amendments effective as of <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--LesseeOperatingLeaseEffectiveDate_dd_c20250929__20260628_zRbKWy6vO4B4" title="Lease effective date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNjaGVkdWxlIG9mIE5vbi1jYW5jZWxsYWJsZSBPcGVyYXRpbmcgTGVhc2VzIE1pbmltdW0gUGF5bWVudHMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-09-29to2026-06-28" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact001480" name="OPXS:LesseeOperatingLeaseEffectiveDate">January 11, 2021</ix:nonNumeric></span> and <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseDiscountRate_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20260628__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--OfficeEquipmentMember_zVsRUZSiG3f2" title="Borrowing discount rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNjaGVkdWxlIG9mIE5vbi1jYW5jZWxsYWJsZSBPcGVyYXRpbmcgTGVhc2VzIE1pbmltdW0gUGF5bWVudHMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDiscountRate" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-28_us-gaap_OfficeEquipmentMember" id="Fact001482" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.7</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the office equipment
    lease agreement effective as of December 11, 2025.</ix:footnote></i></span></td></tr>
