</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A0_zrxbqMDe92N6" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Restricted
Stock Units</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 1, 2024, the Company granted an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zsTfpFDwGcId"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001651" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">39,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to 11 employees under the Company&#8217;s 2023 Equity
Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2023 Plan&#8221;). As of the grant date, assuming a <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--ForfeitureRate_pid_dp_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_ztzeUny5Byec" title="Forfeiture rate"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ForfeitureRate" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001653" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.7</ix:nonFraction></span>% forfeiture rate based on expected turnover across
the three years, the aggregate value of the restricted stock units is $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zPmlLfGVdrTg"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001654" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">258</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand which will be amortized across the three-year period
on a straight-line basis. The restricted stock units will vest at a rate of <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240501__20240501__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zfeFEciT2Ea7" title="Restricted stock units vested"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001656" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">33.33</ix:nonFraction></span>% annually on the anniversary date of the grant and
any unvested restricted stock units will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date. On June 4, 2024 there
was an additional grant of <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zcfzaRVKGc6b"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001657" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to one employee with a fair value of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zizGk8k3JDw"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001658" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">4</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand. The <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zERiUPORFQfl"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001659" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units
will vest <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zMOKMBE14wk9" title="Restricted stock units vested"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember" id="Fact001661" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the anniversary date of the grant and will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date.
On July 3, 2024 there was an additional grant of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240703__20240703__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zJ7x4AX6G633" title="Restricted stock, grant"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001663" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to one employee with a fair value of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240703__20240703__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_z4voSRYHQERf" title="Restricted stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001665" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">7</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand. The <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240703__20240703__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_z8QVp2QJ8tml" title="Number of share grant during period"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001667" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
restricted stock units will vest <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240703__20240703__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zen0OYq2it9j" title="Share based compensation percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001669" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the anniversary date of the grant and will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the
relevant vesting date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the twelve months ended September 28, 2025, there were <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod_pid_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_z6YsGBWsCtwa" title="Restricted stock, vested"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001671" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">24,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares vested and <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardForfeitures_pid_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zieEtb3NgUaf" title="Restricted stock units forfeited"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardForfeitures" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact001673" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USD">7,500</ix:nonFraction></span> shares forfeited under the 2023 Plan.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 1, 2025, the Company granted an aggregate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20250501__20250501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zG6gcTizta9" title="Number of share grant during period"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-05-012025-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001675" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">39,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to 11 employees under the 2023 Plan. As of the grant date,
assuming a <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--ForfeitureRate_pid_dp_c20250501__20250501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_z5uLZhcVYX1h" title="Forfeiture rate"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ForfeitureRate" contextRef="From2025-05-012025-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001677" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12.8</ix:nonFraction></span>% forfeiture rate based on expected turnover across the three years, the aggregate value of the restricted stock units
is $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20250501__20250501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zlSQ0OxmBnS9"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2025-05-012025-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001678" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">216</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand which will be amortized across the three-year period on a straight-line basis. The restricted stock units will vest
at a rate of <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20250501__20250501__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zVIsdkpK2Wr9" title="Shares vested percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2025-05-012025-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001680" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">33.33</ix:nonFraction></span>% on each of the first, second and third anniversaries of the date of the grant and any unvested restricted stock units
will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
October 15, 2025, the Company granted <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20251015__20251015__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zsGWfPm5id6g" title="Number of share grant during period"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2025-10-152025-10-15_custom_OneEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001682" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to one employee under the 2023 Plan. As of the grant date, the fair
value of the restricted stock units is $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20251015__20251015__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_z9r3Nb8Frjy7" title="Restricted stock award gross"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2025-10-152025-10-15_custom_OneEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001684" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">15</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand which will be amortized across the twelve-month period on a straight-line basis.
The restricted stock units will vest on October 15, 2026 and any unvested restricted stock units will be forfeited if employment terminates
prior to the vesting date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 5, 2026, the Company granted <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20260105__20260105__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zE6XZq1WCGkf" title="Number of share grant during period"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-01-052026-01-05_custom_OneEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001686" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to one employee under the 2023 Plan. As of the grant date, the fair
value of the restricted stock units is $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20260105__20260105__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember_zMUdzuWdyfIj" title="Restricted stock award gross"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2026-01-052026-01-05_custom_OneEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreePlanMember" id="Fact001688" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">13</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand which will be amortized across the twelve-month period on a straight-line basis.
The restricted stock units will vest on January 5, 2026 and any unvested restricted stock units will be forfeited if employment terminates
prior to the vesting date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

