    <td style="font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">16.8</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">%</span></td></tr>
